{"availability":"available","full":"aurorascharff/next16-airline","name":"next16-airline","description":"An airline booking demo exploring Cache Components, Partial Prefetching, and the prefetch() and navigation() APIs with Next.js 16.4, React 19, Tailwind CSS v4, and Prisma.","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":12,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-17T10:31:01Z","updated":"2026-09-29T08:48:40Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://next16-airline.vercel.app","topics":["app-router","async-react","cache-components","nextjs","optimistic-ui","prisma","react19","rsc","server-actions","suspense","tailwindcss-v4","view-transitions"],"demo":"https://next16-airline.vercel.app/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T15:03:49.978Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T15:03:49.978Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T15:03:49.978Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T05:41:35.153Z","stars":11,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-08T06:38:27.086Z","stars":12,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-10T15:03:49.978Z","stars":12,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["An airline booking demo, from flight search to a stored trip, that demonstrates Instant Navigations in Next.js 16.4.","The architecture follows the Next.js App Architecture skill and the Component Architecture for React Server Components blog post."],"features":["Cache Components cache each query with 'use cache', name the data with cacheTag, and set its lifetime with cacheLife. Search results and flight offers use 'use cache: remote' so serverless instances share one cache, and…","Partial Prefetching prefetches one shared App Shell per route. The link to the next booking step uses prefetch={true}, which also resolves its cached offer.","prefetch() and navigation() are awaited in the components that render trips, holds, and flight lists, which moves those reads to a per-link prefetch or to the navigation while keeping them cached.","Server Functions hold seats, confirm, and cancel trips on the server, and invalidate only the tags they change with updateTag.","React Compiler memoizes components and hooks automatically, so the code needs no manual useMemo or useCallback."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/aurorascharff/next16-airline/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"10481da2c4676cbb5f14a59d633c13df63b38df41ed6f99a90cd1fec204bfe5b","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T05:41:35.259Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T05:41:35.259Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"An airline booking demo, from flight search to a stored trip, that demonstrates Instant Navigations in Next.js 16.4.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/aurorascharff/next16-airline/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"10481da2c4676cbb5f14a59d633c13df63b38df41ed6f99a90cd1fec204bfe5b","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/aurorascharff/next16-airline/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T05:41:35.260Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-09-29T08:48:40Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/aurorascharff/next16-airline/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T05:41:35.260Z","hash":"10481da2c4676cbb5f14a59d633c13df63b38df41ed6f99a90cd1fec204bfe5b","originalBytes":5918,"storedBytes":5918,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["cache","pnpm","run","prefetch","navigation","prisma","app","components","flight","react","server","url","database","next","next.js","unstable","architecture","bash","cached","data","demo","file","instant","playwright","postgres","read","seats","set","shell","sqlite","trips","waypoint","which","after","airline","arrives","booking","canary","compiler","each","end-to-end","env.local","functions","hold","holds","how","license","list","locally","navigations","one","only","partial","per","per-link","postgresql","prefetching","prisma.push","prisma.seed","provider","remote","search","seat","static","stay","suspense","swap","tests","they","transitions","useoptimistic","view","while",